### Task06 real C/D required. Headers are placeholders: obtain D's actual signed service request.
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@bearer = replace-with-valid-manager-jwt
@clientId = replace-with-registered-hr-client
@keyId = replace-with-public-key-id
@timestamp = replace-with-current-timestamp
@nonce = replace-for-each-attempt
@signature = replace-with-D-compatible-Ed25519-signature

### DP01 defaults includeDescendants=true; flat items, scope roots with false
GET {{baseUrl}}/departments?includeDescendants=true
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}

### DP02 defaults false, same authorized department set for items/total
GET {{baseUrl}}/departments/17/users?includeDescendants=true&page=1&pageSize=20
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}

### HR01 optional manager; root parentDeptCode="", otherwise stable known code
PUT {{baseUrl}}/integrations/hr/departments/D017
Content-Type: application/json
X-Client-Id: {{clientId}}
X-Key-Id: {{keyId}}
X-Request-Timestamp: {{timestamp}}
X-Request-Nonce: {{nonce}}
X-Request-Signature: {{signature}}

{"sourceSystem":"HR","eventId":"HR-D-001","eventVersion":10,"deptCode":"D017","deptName":"Example department","parentDeptCode":"D001","occurredAt":"2026-10-16T12:00:00+08:00"}

### HR05 source version10 + target40 + event11 => source11 target40
POST {{baseUrl}}/integrations/hr/merges
Content-Type: application/json
X-Client-Id: {{clientId}}
X-Key-Id: {{keyId}}
X-Request-Timestamp: {{timestamp}}
X-Request-Nonce: {{nonce}}
X-Request-Signature: {{signature}}

{"sourceSystem":"HR","eventId":"HR-M-001","eventVersion":11,"sourceDeptCode":"D017","targetDeptCode":"D018","occurredAt":"2026-10-16T12:00:00+08:00"}

### DP03 freezes this marker only; does not modify accounts/roles
POST {{baseUrl}}/departments/17/freeze
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason":"Organization review"}

### DP04 requires currently eligible unrestricted superior/recovery actor
POST {{baseUrl}}/departments/17/unfreeze
Authorization: Bearer {{bearer}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"reason":"Review completed"}
